            "speaker_id": 538335,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, let's kick off the Warehouse Heavy-Goods Relocation project. The main goal is to move bulky items while improving our safety standards. I've started mapping the current layout for T1 in the draft plan A1. Please take a look and share your thoughts on which zones we should prioritize for the first phase.",
