      {
        "thread_id": "TH4",
        "thread_goal": "Run the pilot relocation, capture issues, and agree on improvements.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M47",
            "speaker_id": 538335,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, we are starting the pilot relocation of Zone D now (T7). Please be extra vigilant. Log any and all issues, delays, or near-misses in the incident log A5. No detail is too small. This feedback is crucial for a smooth rollout.",
            "mentions": [
              373940,
              221215,
              216869,
              62106
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T7",
              "A5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M48",
            "speaker_id": 221215,
            "reply_to": "M47",
            "text": "On it. First few pallets are moving now.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M49",
            "speaker_id": 373940,
            "reply_to": "M47",
            "text": "Just logged a near-miss in A5. A box of fittings slid off a pallet while turning. The plastic wrap seemed a bit loose. No damage, but it was close.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "👀",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M50",
            "speaker_id": 62106,
            "reply_to": "M47",
            "text": "We had to stop for about 15 minutes because the route was blocked by a delivery truck that wasn't on the schedule. I put it in the log A5.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M51",
            "speaker_id": 538335,
            "reply_to": "M49",
            "text": "Thanks for logging that @373940. That's exactly the kind of thing we need to catch. We need to check our wrapping procedure.",
            "mentions": [
              373940
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M52",
            "speaker_id": 216869,
            "reply_to": "M47",
            "text": "Pilot for Zone D is complete. Thanks everyone for your hard work and for diligently logging issues. I've reviewed the A5 log and summarized the findings in the lessons learned doc, A7.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A5",
              "A7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "🎉",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M53",
            "speaker_id": 216869,
            "reply_to": "M52",
            "text": "Key takeaways from A7: 1) The pallet wrapping needs to be more robust. 2) The planned route is good but vulnerable to unscheduled traffic. We need better coordination with receiving. 3) The stacking pattern for cylindrical containers was confusing for some.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M54",
            "speaker_id": 538335,
            "reply_to": "M53",
            "text": "Based on this, I propose we make a double-wrap mandatory for all non-crated loads. For the route, we should use the secondary access lane as a backup. It's longer but avoids receiving entirely. And we need to improve the visual guide for stacking.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M55",
            "speaker_id": 216869,
            "reply_to": "M54",
            "text": "Those are excellent, actionable improvements. So, first decision: is the pilot approach acceptable for the full rollout *if we implement these changes*?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D6"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M56",
            "speaker_id": 221215,
            "reply_to": "M55",
            "text": "Yes, with those changes it will be much smoother.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M57",
            "speaker_id": 373940,
            "reply_to": "M55",
            "text": "I agree.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M58",
            "speaker_id": 216869,
            "reply_to": "M55",
            "text": "Great. Second decision: let's agree on these specific updates for T8. 1) Update SOP to mandate double-wrapping. 2) Update move plan in A1 with backup route. 3) I will take the action to create a clearer visual guide for stacking.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T8",
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D7"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
